      "name": "Masterpiece Scroll",
      "text": "CL18 — Masterpiece Scroll\nYou can prepare one Masterpiece Scroll.\nPaint Masterpiece\nRitual Time: 1 hour\nCost: 5 Qi\nChoose one Masterpiece:\n- Guardian Beast.\n- Painted Landscape.\nYou may maintain one prepared Masterpiece Scroll.\nPreparing another destroys the previous Scroll.\nThe Scroll persists until activated or destroyed.\nActivate Masterpiece\nAction\nRange: 90 feet\nDuration: 1 minute\nConcentration: Required\nCost: 8 Qi\nLimit: Once per scene\nConsume the Masterpiece Scroll and manifest its chosen Masterpiece.\n---"
