      "source": "TAL_WEATHER_PRESSURE_CRACKING_SHROUD",
      "name": "Pressure-Cracking Shroud",
      "text": "Pressure-Cracking Shroud\nTo learn this, you need CL 10+, Severe Shroud\nWhen a creature fails a saving throw against your Cloud Shroud while inside gathered weather of the same sign, you may spend 2 cultivation points (your Path resource) to crack its resistance to that weather.\nUntil the end of your next turn, the creature loses Resistance to the Shroud’s damage type. If it has immunity, this talent does not remove immunity, but the creature does not gain Advantage on saving throws from adaptation to ordinary weather of that sign."
