      "name": "Hold the Line",
      "text": "Hold the Line - gain +1 AC against creatures inside your Spear Line; - gain Advantage on checks and saving throws against forced movement; - when a creature bearing your Spear Intent enters your Spear Line, it treats that movement as difficult terrain."
