      "name": "Pursuit Spear",
      "text": "Pursuit Spear - Momentum\nWhen you move at least 10 feet directly toward one creature and hit it with an approved Spear weapon attack before the end of the turn, choose one: - add Proficiency Bonus to one damage roll; - push the creature 5 feet; - move 5 feet toward the creature after the attack; - apply Spear Intent. Use Pursuit Spear once per turn."
